    "text": "Please cite WHY you believe in railways? I live in a light rail district. Rails only benefit those directly on the path. Are there major corporations with thousands of jobs on the lines? Are there high rise apartments on the lines? No. Which only benefits 5% of the population tops. And how many of that 5% actually use it? Almost nil when you look at ridership numbers. Then check again at how many actually pay. Because many times they never post cops to enforce ticket purchases. It's always a financial boondoggle operating in the red.",
